SUMMARY:Modernizing Java Applications using GitHub Copilot Modernization A
 gent
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nModernization backlogs continue to 
 grow as organizations face technical debt\, framework upgrades\, cloud mig
 rations\, and architectural change across their Java application portfolio
 s.\n\nIn this session\, learn how GitHub Copilot Modernization Agent analy
 zes applications\, identifies modernization opportunities\, generates migr
 ation plans\, and accelerates code transformation.\n\nThrough live demos\,
  see how organizations can modernize Java applications faster\, reduce man
 ual effort\, and move from legacy systems to cloud and AI-ready architectu
 res with greater confidence.\n\nKey Takeaway: Agentic AI is changing the e
 conomics of modernization\, enabling organizations to tackle larger applic
 ation portfolios and accelerate AI transformation at scale.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3163
 02498/
