SUMMARY:Building APIs Faster with Agentic Development and Azure Cosmos DB
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nFrom REST endpoints to serverless A
 PIs\, coding agents can dramatically speed up backend development. This se
 ssion demonstrates how to use an agent to scaffold APIs\, integrate Azure 
 Cosmos DB SDKs\, implement CRUD operations\, and refine the architecture f
 or real-world use.\n\n- Check out the [CosmosDB Agent Kit](https://aka.ms/
 CosmosDB-agentkit)\n- [Azure Cosmos DB Agent Kit for AI coding assistants]
 (https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/cosmos-db/gen-ai/agent-kit/?wt.mc_id=me
 etup_27410_webpage_reactor)\n\n[This session is a part of a series. Learn 
 more here](https://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1678/?wt.mc_id
 =meetup_27410_website_reactor)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3155
 05397/
